# ==============================================================================
# SMTP Email Configuration (Nodemailer)
# ==============================================================================
# To receive live password reset OTPs in your actual email inbox:
# 1. Turn on 2-Step Verification in Google Account: https://myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Generate a 16-character App Password: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Enter your Gmail address in SMTP_USER and the 16-character App Password in SMTP_PASS
# 4. Note: If SMTP_USER or SMTP_PASS is empty, OTP codes will fall back to terminal stdout.
